PicoDrive was started by fDave and is maintained by notaz and irixxxx, with
substantial contributions from the emulator authors credited in each source.

Linked phase-one components include:

* Cyclone 68000 by fDave and contributors
* FAME/C by Chui, based on C68K by Stephane Dallongeville
* CZ80 by Stephane Dallongeville and NJ
* DrZ80 by Reesy and FluBBa
* YM2612 implementation by Tatsuyuki Satoh, Jarek Burczynski, and MAME
* SN76489/SN76496 implementation by the MAME development team

The complete upstream attribution for this pin is recorded in PROVENANCE.md.
